  "title": "Basic Cheese Polenta",
  "description": "Parmesan cheese gives this polenta a nice, subtle cheese flavor. Serve it immediately as a creamy side dish, or chill it so that the polenta can be sliced, then fried or grilled.",
  "authors": [
    "Dawn"
